# Ubuntu for Xiaomi Pad 8 Pro — $release_name

Ubuntu 26.04 LTS with GNOME for the Xiaomi Pad 8 Pro (`piano`, SM8750P), installed next to Android.
This is a preview: read [Read Before Installing]($repo_url/blob/$integration_commit/README.md#%EF%B8%8F-read-before-installing)
first. Installation is manual: follow [docs/INSTALL.md]($repo_url/blob/$integration_commit/docs/INSTALL.md);
switching and recovery are in [docs/FLASHING.md]($repo_url/blob/$integration_commit/docs/FLASHING.md).
All Android data is erased.

Unofficial project based on Ubuntu 26.04 LTS; not affiliated with or endorsed by Canonical, Xiaomi or Qualcomm.

Download every `piano-v0.1.0-preview.tar.zst.part*`, check them with `sha256sum -c SHA256SUMS.assets`,
restore the release directory with `cat piano-v0.1.0-preview.tar.zst.part* | zstd -d | tar -x` (about 14 GB),
then run `sha256sum -c SHA256SUMS` inside it.

